      "The operator who operates SSB operates on Friday.",
      "The operator who operates RTTY operates on Monday.",
      "Nkem does not operate on Wednesday. The operator who operates AM and Wednesday are exactly one day apart in night order, in one direction or the other.",
      "Horace is earlier than Tuesday in night order.",
      "Horace is exactly one day earlier than the operator who operates CW, with no night in between.",
      "The operator who operates FT8 and Yusuf are exactly one day apart in night order, in one direction or the other.",
